stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Offline
  Offline --> Idle: session.started
  Idle --> Listening: microphone.started
  Listening --> Thinking: transcript.final
  Thinking --> Speaking: first audio or text playback
  Speaking --> Interrupted: barge-in / cancel
  Interrupted --> Listening: microphone active
  Interrupted --> Idle: cancelled
  Speaking --> Idle: audio.completed
  Idle --> Celebrating: positive bounded cue
  Celebrating --> Idle: clip completed
  Thinking --> Concerned: validated cue
  Concerned --> Speaking: response ready
  Idle --> ErrorRecovery: recoverable error
  Listening --> ErrorRecovery: capture/provider error
  Thinking --> ErrorRecovery: provider/schema error
  Speaking --> ErrorRecovery: playback error
  ErrorRecovery --> Idle: recovered/fallback
  ErrorRecovery --> Offline: network/session unavailable
  note right of Speaking
    Concurrent layers:
    base life + state + emotion
    + gesture + lip-sync
  end note

